Package: local.syncthing.ios
Name: Syncthing iOS Daemon (unofficial)
Version: 2.1.5-1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Section: Networking
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Local Builder
Depends: firmware (>= 15.5)
Homepage: https://syncthing.net/
Description: Unofficial native Syncthing daemon for rootless jailbroken iOS
 Runs as mobile with a localhost-only web UI on port 8384.
 Requires an active rootless jailbreak, not just TrollStore.
